cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis, please cite it as below. Please also cite the original works it relies on."
title: "The Photon That Didn't Show Up: photon loss and the CHSH trading edge"
abstract: >-
  Open, reproducible investment-diligence study of a fictional startup that sells entanglement-based
  (CHSH-game) coordination to trading desks. It brute-forces the classical limit, models photon loss on
  fibre with a Monte Carlo that drops photons, shows a classical detection-loophole strategy that scores
  82%, maps where quantum could ever beat one classical bit, and tests the business case. Every number is
  produced by code and traceable to results/results.json.
authors:
